<p>I am a software engineer focused on system architecture, AI enablement, and enterprise forms integration (AEM Forms). This blog is a digital workbench—a place to share raw, honest notes, retrospective reviews, and helpful solutions from actual production engineering without the hype.</p>

<p>Currently, I build robust data pipelines, orchestrate cloud form deliveries, and research evaluation methods for LLM-driven architectures.</p>

<h2>Skill Matrix & Stack</h2>
<p>Over the years, I have worked across a wide spectrum of software layers, from front-end schema-bound layouts to complex backend orchestrations:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Languages:</strong> JavaScript (ES6+), Java, Python, SQL</li>
  <li><strong>Enterprise Forms:</strong> AEM Forms, Adaptive Forms, guideBridge scripting, XSD Schema design</li>
  <li><strong>AI Integration:</strong> Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) evaluation, LLM orchestration, synthetic data generation</li>
  <li><strong>Cloud & Architecture:</strong> Microservices, Serverless, Docker, CI/CD pipelines</li>
</ul>

